    "updated_at": "2020-05-09T12:43:53Z",
    "body": "Yes of course there is interest for that.\r\nI would also like to add that regardless of interest otpauth should be added, as i do not see any new risks in doing so.\r\nEven with out this tricking a user into giving away their topt/hotp secret by scanning a qr code via a website / having them enter the information is not much harder (in terms of permission requests etc. that a user would have to (in most brwosers) accept).",
